      "created_at": "2017-04-24T15:38:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So Sky-Scraper's outfit changes size with her, as evidenced by her not being naked in half her cards. I was thinking it might be some super-fabric she brought with her from home, but her new outfit on Extremist also changes size, as does, presumably, her bandana in the Prime Wars art.</p><p>So can she make other things change size as well, or is it just things that are in physical contact with her when she shifts?</p>",
