      "created_at": "2017-04-24T18:50:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Her costume is made up of unstable particles. . .</p><p>I mean how does Faye Diamond keep her outfit when she does into mist mode? The answer is what ever comic book reason they want her to have so she follows the comic code. . . &nbsp;</p><p>The unstable bit is in referance to the Fantasic Four. It would be nice to know for the nerd in me but I am sure it would be answered in one line.</p>",
