      "created_at": "2017-04-26T02:51:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I was thinking of the previous discussion. I did ask some “what’s in the cryo chamber?” type questions, but I went more for the angle of asking what Frost does/can do with his time than asking physiological questions that come down to “because comics.”</p>\n<p>If you want to ask about the solid oxygen, go ahead. We can see if both our questions get answered. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
