      "id": 196948,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-26T18:34:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Absolute Zero is immortal, he is alive, yet cannot eat or drink or breathe. &nbsp;He has innate magical powers that allow him to see, move and make sound. &nbsp;Unless something manages to kill him, he will survive the heat death of the universe, where in spite of being horribly bored he will actually be comfortable.</p><p>His suit is also magical. &nbsp;No amount of insulation or technology is going to allow a suit that thin to have one side be -273 and the other side 30 degrees without building up an incredible layer of ice nearly instantly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Absolue Zero, therefore, must be not only immortal, but also the most powerful Magical human in the Multiverse.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:24:32.808Z",
