      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/{size}/2010_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-26T18:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Absolute Zero's accident caused his body to become a portal to the Frost Dimension (he was saying his own name to himself right as the blast occurred and it served as a sort of summoning incantation). The sudden and extreme flow of energy between dimensions would tear his body apart and kill him as the dimensions sought find the energy equilibrium between them. The suit is not there to insulate but it's more of an interdimensional gate regulator. The energy and temperature differential on either side of the suit is because the two sides exist in different dimensions.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That, or comics.&nbsp;</p>",
